 ### Add Overloads to Avoid params Array Allocation
 🟡 **DO** add 1- and 2-argument overloads for methods that accept `params T[]`, or use `params ReadOnlySpan<T>` on .NET 9+ | .NET Core+

 ❌
 ```csharp
